  "title": "Hungarian Noodle Side Dish",
  "description": "Dust off your slow cooker and make a pot of creamy, tangy egg noodles, rich with sour cream, cream of mushroom soup, cottage cheese and Parmesan, and spicy with Worchestershire, garlic powder, hot pepper sauce and a dash of paprika.",
  "authors": [
    "CORWYNN DARKHOLME"
